<title>UK: Datastream/ICV expands Dow Jones tie-up.</title>
<headline>Datastream/ICV expands Dow Jones tie-up.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Datastream/ICV said on Friday that it would sell and promote the services of U.S. information group Dow Jones in Scotland and the north east of England.</p>
<p>The agreement is an extension of the partnership forged last year between Dow Jones and Primark Corporation, the parent of Datastream/ICV.</p>
<p>Dan Casey, the managing director of Dow Jones Markets said the information vendor would continue to distribute and support its own applications throughout the rest of the UK.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
